	'k989e0def' => 'Sleep medicine · Seattle',
	'k98ece6bc' => 'Timing and light plan',
	'k9c88e1d4' => 'Insomnia and early morning awakenings',
	'ka01fd767' => 'Step 2: First consultation and two-week sleep diary',
	'ka09f8d69' => 'Dr. Ellery founded Nemuri Clinic in 2016 to ensure working adults could access thorough evening sleep evaluations. She sits with you during your results visit to explain what your night recording reveals.',
	'ka2f05652' => 'What to bring for your overnight stay',
	'ka335593a' => 'Home test or our room',
	'ka3a1ffca' => 'Results visit',
	'ka633ac8d' => 'Cognitive Behavioural Therapy for Insomnia (CBT-I)',
	'ka67dc072' => 'The snoring someone else heard — Daniel\'s story',
	'ka6ddbe0d' => 'Attending a sleep clinic for the first time should feel calm, clear, and reassuring. From your initial evening consultation to your diagnostic recording and follow-up plan, we guide you through each stage of care without rush or confusion.',
	'ka6f99fdb' => 'We arrange a recorded night study to measure your airway, oxygen levels, and nighttime breathing stability.',
	'ka76efba8' => 'Step 1: Booking your appointment',
	'ka79199e0' => 'Follow-up consultation',
	'ka923acd3' => '60 min with a sleep physician, two-week sleep diary handed out',
	'ka9e3eaf6' => 'When an overnight study reveals obstructive sleep apnea, Continuous Positive Airway Pressure therapy provides gentle, pneumatic splinting of the upper airway to prevent breathing pauses and maintain steady nocturnal oxygenation. Successful CPAP therapy depends on comfortable equipment fitting and compassionate clinical guidance. Nurse Grace Lin leads our CPAP set-up and first-month coaching service, available for $210. Grace works with you to select an appropriate nasal or full-face mask, adjust pressure ramp settings, and troubleshoot early challenges such as mask leaks or nasal dryness. At the four-week mark, she performs an objective data download to review compliance hours and residual respiratory events, ensuring your transition to nightly therapy is comfortable and effective.',
	'kaa9d2827' => 'Ana, a 41-year-old project manager in Seattle, had spent nearly two years waking up at 3 a.m. every single night. After falling asleep without difficulty at 23:00, she would suddenly find herself wide awake in the dark, her thoughts racing through project deadlines and unfinished spreadsheets while the bedside clock ticked away. When she arrived at Nemuri Clinic for an evening consultation, Dr. Hana Ellery conducted a thorough medical review and arranged a one-night home sleep test to check for subtle airway resistance. The recording confirmed that Ana had no respiratory disturbances or oxygen drops. Her awakenings were driven by conditioned nocturnal arousal and irregular bedtimes. Ana enrolled in our six-session CBT-I programme with sleep psychologist Dr. Priya Raman. Together, they established a strict, consistent rise time, dismantled anxious habits around wakefulness, and reorganized her evening wind-down routine. By retraining her body clock and strengthening her biological sleep drive, Ana gradually restored consolidated, unbroken rest.',
	'kabb142b6' => 'How quickly will I receive the results of my sleep test?',
	'kac36ab77' => 'Dr. Hana Ellery founded Nemuri Clinic in 2016 after years of clinical work in hospital sleep medicine. During those years, she noticed a persistent pattern: working adults with debilitating sleep difficulties regularly cancelled appointments or postponed evaluations because clinic hours conflicted with their professional responsibilities. Taking half a day off to discuss exhaustion often felt impossible for the people who needed care most. Nemuri Clinic was created to eliminate that barrier entirely. Our consultations run throughout the afternoon from 13:00 to 17:00 and continue into the evening from 17:30 until 21:00, Tuesday through Friday, with additional Saturday hours from 09:00 to 15:00. By keeping our doors open late in Suite 210 on Alder Lane, we ensure that an evaluation fits naturally around your working day rather than interrupting it.',
	'kac616f84' => 'Fri',
	'kac848fa2' => 'Team',
	'kacb62932' => 'Nemuri Clinic is located at Suite 210, 88 Alder Lane, Seattle, WA 98101. Our central location is situated a short walk from downtown transit routes, making the clinic easily accessible for patients commuting directly after their working day. When you arrive at 88 Alder Lane, take the building elevator to the second floor and turn right toward Suite 210. Our waiting area provides a quiet, comfortable space where front desk manager Malik Hassan will greet you and ensure your visit proceeds smoothly.',
	'kaf1724c0' => 'Daniel, 52, bus dispatcher',
	'kaf50d50b' => 'You leave with a clear idea of what we will look at next and why.',
	'kaf74ae25' => 'CBT-I programme',
	'kafa481b2' => 'Treatment programmes and therapy support',
	'kafc27343' => 'Snoring someone else heard',
	'kb04026e8' => 'Two weeks',
	'kb23da1a0' => 'One night',
	'kb2871b0f' => 'Lucía Ferrer — Sleep Technologist',
	'kb31f4f0b' => 'Night study in our room',
	'kb33561cf' => '45 min, the physician reads the night with you',
	'kb356cdd4' => 'Whichever suits your history, the recording is read by a physician, not a program.',
	'kb49a6a0b' => 'A single quiet study room, not an assembly line',
	'kb5ff43f9' => 'For chronic insomnia and fractured sleep, Cognitive Behavioural Therapy for Insomnia is the internationally recommended first-line treatment. Led by sleep psychologist Dr. Priya Raman, our structured CBT-I programme consists of six weekly 50-minute individual sessions priced at $780. Rather than offering generic sleep hygiene tips, Dr. Raman works closely with your fourteen-day sleep diary data to implement targeted behavioral strategies. You will practice sleep restriction therapy to consolidate broken rest into continuous sleep, stimulus control to rebuild the mental association between bed and sleep, and cognitive reframing to dismantle nocturnal sleep anxiety. By establishing a fixed morning rise time and strengthening your natural homeostatic sleep drive, CBT-I creates lasting, drug-free improvements in sleep quality.',
	'kb7119017' => 'This record provides essential context for interpreting any nighttime physiological testing that follows.',
	'kb90735df' => 'Sensors and set-up',
	'kbab165a3' => 'Nemuri Clinic is a self-pay clinic, and payment is due at the time of your visit. We accept major credit cards, debit cards, and electronic payments. Following every consultation, diagnostic test, or therapy session, we provide an itemised receipt containing detailed diagnostic codes and procedural descriptions. You may submit this itemised receipt directly to your insurance company or health savings account for potential reimbursement; however, we cannot promise what your insurer will reimburse. If you need to reschedule or cancel an appointment, please provide at least 24 hours of notice. Cancellations made with less than 24 hours of advance notice incur a fixed $60 cancellation fee.',
	'kbc09fff8' => 'While Nemuri Clinic provides specialized outpatient care for chronic sleep disorders, certain medical symptoms require immediate medical evaluation by an emergency department or your primary care physician. If you experience chest pain, sudden shortness of breath, unexplained heart palpitations, or severe nighttime dizziness, seek emergency medical care without delay. Furthermore, if you struggle with uncontrollable drowsy driving or have had near-miss incidents behind the wheel due to overwhelming sleepiness, you must refrain from operating motor vehicles until you have undergone urgent medical evaluation. Our outpatient clinic does not provide emergency intervention or acute crisis care.',
	'kbe81177f' => 'What is your clinic cancellation and rescheduling policy?',
	'kbf32b7da' => 'Three quiet stories',
	'kbf6a9431' => 'Nemuri Clinic brings together seven dedicated healthcare professionals in Seattle specializing in sleep medicine, nocturnal physiology, sleep psychology, and patient care. Working during afternoon and evening hours, our team is committed to unhurried, evidence-based sleep evaluations.',
	'kc278d970' => 'Senior sleep technologist',
	'kc2ba7e78' => 'Service',
	'kc3b2b46f' => 'A daily plan for rise time, light and meals, written around your work pattern and reviewed at follow-up visits. Follow-up consultation $95.',
	'kc5302e04' => 'Severe daytime sleepiness and brain fog',
	'kc6d1229f' => 'Restless legs and nighttime limb sensations',
	'kc70602a9' => 'For your initial 60-minute consultation, please bring a valid government-issued photo identification and a comprehensive, up-to-date list of all prescription medications, over-the-counter supplements, and vitamins you currently take, including dosage details. If you have kept a sleep diary, sleep log, or wearable device sleep summary over the past two weeks, please bring those notes along. These records offer valuable background information that helps our sleep physicians understand your baseline sleep patterns and daytime energy levels from your very first visit.',
	'kc71bf2f2' => 'Itemised receipt provided for every visit. Self-pay fees in USD. We cannot promise what your insurer will reimburse.',
	'kc8670133' => 'Struggling to stay awake through afternoon meetings or long commutes signals unrefreshing sleep.',
	'kcb9f632d' => '© 2016–2026 Nemuri Clinic',
	'kcbb37401' => 'Stories',
	'kcd9c151a' => 'Nemuri Clinic is conveniently located in downtown Seattle, offering consultation hours throughout the afternoon and evening so you never have to take time away from your working day. Our clinic suite provides a calm, quiet setting for consultations and overnight sleep studies.',
	'kce2973b0' => 'Lucía Ferrer manages our portable home sleep testing services and assists with in-lab polysomnography procedures. Lucía prepares diagnostic equipment kits, explains sensor setup step-by-step during afternoon clinic visits, and guides patients on recording their sleep at home. Her clear instructions and supportive guidance ensure that home test data is captured accurately and returned smoothly to our front desk for timely physician reading.',
	'kce328420' => 'To support working professionals in Seattle, our clinic operates during afternoon and evening hours. Outpatient consultations take place Tuesday through Friday from 13:00 to 17:00, with late evening appointments available from 17:30 to 21:00. On Saturdays, we offer morning and early afternoon appointments from 09:00 to 15:00. Overnight sleep studies in our private suite are scheduled Tuesday through Thursday nights, with patient check-in at 20:30 and departure at 07:00 the following morning. The clinic is closed on Sundays, Mondays, and all official public holidays. Scheduling inquiries can be made by calling (206) 555-0142 or emailing hello@nemuriclinic.example.',
	'kce50fb75' => 'To ensure your night in our Seattle clinic feels as natural and comfortable as possible, please bring loose, comfortable sleepwear such as pyjamas or a t-shirt and shorts. Pack your personal toiletries, a toothbrush, and any prescription medications you routinely take in the evening or morning. You are welcome to bring a favourite book or reading material to help you unwind before bedtime. Please avoid consuming caffeinated beverages, alcohol, or heavy daytime naps after 12:00 on the day of your study. We also request that you arrive with clean, dry hair free of styling gels or oils, which allows our scalp sensors to adhere cleanly and maintain clear signal connectivity throughout the recording.',
	'kcefc76fb' => 'We look at sleep timing, night habits and whether hidden breathing issues or conditioned alertness keep you up.',
	'kcf550586' => 'hello@nemuriclinic.example',
	'kd02f105e' => 'A technologist on watch',
	'kd0fbda98' => 'Page not found',
	'kd1c07f07' => 'How do I return the portable home sleep test kit after my recording?',
	'kd5801ba1' => 'Shift-work sleep disruption',
	'kd73adf43' => 'Mei, a 34-year-old intensive care unit nurse, struggled with the exhausting physiological toll of rotating hospital shifts. Alternating between day shifts and overnight blocks left her biological clock thoroughly disorganized. Arriving home at dawn with bright morning sunlight streaming across the Seattle streets, she found her mind wired and alert despite overwhelming physical exhaustion. Her daytime sleep was shallow, restless, and frequently interrupted after barely three hours, leaving her drained before her next shift began. During her initial evening visit at Nemuri Clinic, our team reviewed her roster and two-week sleep diary data. Dr. Ellery constructed an individualized light and sleep-timing plan calibrated specifically around her rotating hospital schedule. The plan utilized wraparound dark glasses during morning commutes, blackout bedroom management, and carefully timed wake windows. By providing clear environmental cues to anchor her circadian pacemaker, Mei successfully stabilized her rest periods and significantly reduced shift-related fatigue.',
	'kd924b019' => 'Following your results review, we establish a personalized treatment plan tailored to your diagnosis, lifestyle, and preferences. For insomnia, you may begin our six-session CBT-I programme with sleep psychologist Dr. Priya Raman. For sleep apnea, nurse Grace Lin coordinates your CPAP mask fitting, pressure coaching, and four-week compliance check. Other patients benefit from circadian light protocols or specialist referrals to ENT surgeons and dental sleep providers. Follow-up consultations lasting 30 minutes are available at $95 to adjust your care as your sleep improves.',
	'kda0fe492' => 'Navigating rotating hospital shifts disrupted her daytime sleep. We built a tailored light-exposure and sleep-timing schedule around her roster to protect her restorative rest.',
	'kdc405c47' => 'Finding us',
	'kdd296825' => 'Symptoms',
	'kdd35af0d' => 'Every sleep journey is distinct, shaped by personal physiology, work routines, and life circumstances. These accounts illustrate how systematic diagnostic evaluation and personalized care have helped working adults in Seattle understand and address their sleep challenges.',
	'kdd5702e0' => 'First consultation',
	'kdd5bf1be' => 'Dr. Hana Ellery',
	'kddf9ee39' => 'Lucía Ferrer sets you up during an evening pickup and shows you how to wear the recorder.',
	'kde636302' => 'Meet all seven',
	'kdec56bb2' => 'Let\'s read the night together.',
	'kdfd49457' => 'Not every sleep condition is best resolved through CPAP therapy or psychological counseling alone. When anatomical airway obstruction, enlarged tonsils, nasal septal deviations, or chronic sinus issues contribute to sleep-disordered breathing, Dr. Tomas Varga coordinates referrals to trusted ear, nose, and throat (ENT) surgeons for specialized surgical assessment. Similarly, for patients with mild to moderate obstructive sleep apnea who struggle with CPAP intolerance, we collaborate with qualified dental sleep specialists to fabricate custom mandibular advancement oral appliances. We also coordinate with neurology specialists when atypical movement disorders or narcolepsy are suspected. All treatment options and associated clinic consultation fees are clearly outlined on our fees page.',
	'ke0037983' => 'Who sits with the result',
	'ke09ea743' => 'Malik Hassan manages our front desk and appointment scheduling at Suite 210 on Alder Lane. Malik coordinates afternoon and evening consultations, explains visit preparation guidelines, and manages records intake with welcoming efficiency. He assists patients with appointment arrangements by phone at (206) 555-0142 and email, ensuring your path to sleep care in Seattle is smooth, clear, and organized from your very first inquiry.',
	'ke0a1069c' => 'Consultation and diagnostic fees',
	'ke23bfe23' => 'Sleeping after a night shift',
	'ke380af58' => 'Nemuri Clinic operates strictly as a self-pay clinic, meaning we do not bill insurance carriers directly, and payment is collected at the time services are rendered. We provide an itemised receipt containing standardized diagnostic codes and billing descriptions for every consultation, home test, and overnight study. You can submit this receipt directly to your insurance company or flexible spending account for potential reimbursement. Because insurance policies and coverage terms vary significantly between different providers, we cannot promise what your insurer will reimburse.',
	'ke534fd19' => 'What should I bring with me to my first consultation?',
	'ke64629de' => 'Consultations',
	'ke79c6603' => 'Meet the team',
	'ke9c615bf' => 'Within 10 days of completing your overnight recording or home sleep test, you return to the clinic for a 45-minute results visit with your physician, priced at $140. Rather than simply delivering a diagnosis, your doctor sits with you to review your hypnogram and physiological recordings in detail. We examine sleep stages, oxygen stability, and micro-arousals together, translating complex scientific graphs into plain, understandable insights about how your body behaves during sleep and how those findings relate to your daytime exhaustion.',
	'kead37804' => 'Within 10 days',
	'kebc1270a' => 'Three common paths',
	'kebfa208d' => 'You return for a 45-minute evening visit where the physician sits down with you to review the night\'s recording line by line.',
	'ked080a13' => 'Reading your night together in plain language',
	'ked5e8353' => 'Thu',
	'keda991b2' => 'Owen oversees our overnight clinic studies, monitoring sensor signals and patient comfort throughout the quiet hours. He ensures every recording gathered between 20:30 and 07:00 is precise and complete.',
	'kedf7553d' => 'Find us',
	'kef6572e4' => 'Sun',
	'kf1d0c6c1' => 'Home sleep test',
	'kf1e2f568' => 'Owen Mbeki or another technologist stays at the desk throughout, checking the signal and the room.',
	'kf237feae' => 'For patients whose symptoms primarily suggest obstructive breathing disorders, a home sleep test offers a convenient and effective way to record sleep in your own bed. Sleep technologist Lucía Ferrer prepares your compact diagnostic kit and walks you through the equipment during an afternoon clinic visit. The kit includes an unobtrusive chest belt to monitor respiratory effort, a soft nasal cannula to measure airflow, and a lightweight finger clip to record blood oxygen levels and pulse rate. You take the kit home, apply the comfortable sensors at bedtime, and sleep in your familiar environment. The following morning, you return the recorder to our front desk. The $320 fee covers the kit preparation, personalized set-up instruction, and a physician reading.',
	'kf3b6234c' => 'An accurate recording of your sleep provides the objective physiological data needed to understand why your nights feel fragmented or unrefreshing. Depending on your symptoms and clinical history, we offer both portable home sleep testing kits and private overnight studies in our Seattle clinic.',
	'kf4c6f851' => 'Notes',
	'kf5de1ef9' => 'Sleep difficulties take many different forms, from waking in the middle of the night to heavy daytime exhaustion and irregular sleep schedules. We evaluate your symptoms carefully through detailed clinical discussions and objective overnight recordings to identify what is disrupting your rest.',
	'kf61ec10f' => 'Ongoing therapy fees at Nemuri Clinic are structured clearly so you can plan your care with confidence. Our specialized Cognitive Behavioural Therapy for Insomnia (CBT-I) programme with sleep psychologist Dr. Priya Raman costs $780, encompassing six weekly 50-minute individual clinical sessions dedicated to restoring healthy sleep patterns. For patients diagnosed with obstructive sleep apnea who begin respiratory therapy, our CPAP set-up and first-month check service is priced at $210. This service includes a comprehensive mask fitting and education session with nurse Grace Lin, personalized pressure adjustment coaching, and a formal objective data download and compliance check at four weeks. All fees are charged in USD at the time of service.',
	'kf62de068' => 'Your sleep diary',
	'kf92f0483' => 'check-in 20:30, out 07:00',
	'kfa485e29' => '▲ Saturday 09:00–15:00. Closed Sunday, Monday and public holidays.',
	'kfa98023f' => 'Founded the clinic in 2016. Leads initial evaluations and reads the recordings with you.',
	'kfab4f913' => 'fitting, coaching, data check at four weeks',
	'kfae70b56' => 'A home test or our study room can show whether breathing is interrupted during the night.',
	'kfc30b1ce' => 'Grace Lin fits the mask, coaches you through the first nights and checks the data at four weeks. $210.',
	'kfd29458a' => 'Mon',
	'kfd8ae824' => 'Ana, 41, project manager',
	'kfe0a7da1' => 'Many patients worry that sleeping in an unfamiliar clinic environment while wearing physiological monitoring sensors will prevent them from drifting off. Our Seattle study room is intentionally designed to feel quiet, dim, and welcoming, resembling a calm bedroom rather than a sterile hospital laboratory. Senior sleep technologist Owen Mbeki ensures all sensors are applied comfortably with gentle adhesives. Even if you sleep less than usual, modern polysomnographic recording captures hours of vital sleep architecture and respiratory data that provide significant clinical value.',
